# 3. FIRST PRINCIPLE

Do NOT redesign the product around:

```text
TENANT APP
LANDLORD APP
AGENT APP
ADMIN APP
```

Instead, design around:

```text
ONE IDENTITY
     ↓
ONE ACCOUNT
     ↓
MULTIPLE POSSIBLE ROLES
     ↓
MULTIPLE CONTEXTS
     ↓
ROLE + RELATIONSHIP + PERMISSION
     ↓
APP EXPERIENCE
```

A person owns an identity.

Roles are capabilities/context.

Permissions determine what they can do.

Relationships determine what resources they can act upon.

The mobile and web applications are experiences over the same identity and authorization system.

