# 11. REDESIGN ONBOARDING AS A PROGRESSIVE FLOW

Do not make onboarding a single giant form.

Determine the minimum information needed to begin using the platform.

A strong conceptual model is:

```text
Phone verification
       ↓
Basic identity
       ↓
"What brings you here?"
       ↓
Initial role/context
       ↓
Minimal onboarding
       ↓
Enter product
       ↓
Progressively complete verification/profile
```

The user should not be blocked from useful parts of the product merely because a future role-specific field is incomplete, unless that capability genuinely requires it.

For example:

```text
Tenant
 ├── can browse
 ├── can save listings
 ├── can request viewing
 └── later complete identity verification
```

while:

```text
Landlord
 ├── can create basic profile
 ├── can begin property setup
 └── must complete required verification before publishing
```

The exact rules must be determined from the existing implementation.

