24. One thing I'd do differently from many startups

Don't integrate DSTV/electricity providers directly into your core application code.

Create an abstraction:

Your Platform
      │
      ▼
Service Integration Layer
      │
 ┌────┼─────────┐
 │    │         │
Provider A   Provider B   Provider C

Your application says:

"Purchase prepaid electricity."

The integration layer determines which provider/API should process it.

That means if your provider changes later, you don't have to rewrite the tenant application, payment system, invoices, etc.

The same principle applies to payment gateways.

